{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n \n 昔のドラマを観るのにはまってます。\n 今見ているのは昔は怖くて見れなかったものです。\n \n 餃子がとても食べたくなります。\n 指をパチンとしたくなります。\n 悟ります。\n お疲れやまです。\n \n さてなんのドラマでしょう。\n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n \n 今日はRe:Mindのイベントがありました。\n \n そうです。\n あの懐かしの制服を着ました〜〜\n \n じゃん\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ21K4ZDJQEPKYRY7NAZNPCD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n この制服を着るだけで\n あのときのことを沢山思い出しました！\n 胸がぎゅーんとなりました。\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ21M0XTYXDHGGV0CTTNNZRK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n \n ドラマの時は髪長かったな〜とか、\n 一人だけ半袖で後半が異常にに寒かったな〜とか、\n 何を見ても何かを思い出しました📚\n \n \n あんなに濃くて素敵な時間を過ごせたのは\n 本当に幸せでした！いつでも戻りたくなります。\n \n \n \n でもこの制服も見納めかな〜🎓\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ21N9TDTDYBPXPDS39S3N2F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n \n \n イベントに来てくださった方々、\n ありがとうございました！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 前々回の握手会のときにいただいた\n お花を載せます！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ21NAT8VBE82J21HAJTYBS4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ21NBRQV5CAYFFJBQ3Y2EBX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ21NCZ6BCTZ6BZQK12X79Q8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ21NE2ND2BBP0R0WVTCENXN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ21NF9M2TYTR7BPJCTYHJHR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ21NGB6FX4GVNW7PRYAETC9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ21NHGX39JQGC0GS1K29FP2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ21NJKN2CAZX9XHKZ23GEFW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n  \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ21NKQ1M39N493E98E05W48","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n ランウェイが決まった直後だったので\n こんなにもたくさんのお祝いが😭\n 嬉しすぎます！ありがとうございました😭😭\n \n \n \n \n \n 明日は名古屋で「アンビバレント」初の\n 全国握手会があります！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ21NMZD8KVY94GVT6ATPDHT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n きょんくみレーンで\n お待ちしてます🍥\n \n \n \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}